    "body": "Scope note for when PR #829 merges. Two of this issue's \"Done means\" were re-scoped, since the 770MX/1100MX have **BT30** spindles, not TTS (Tormach's mill comparison):\n- **The machine-file holder default** moves to #828.\n- **The hardware check:** the user's own 770MX holders are BT30 ER20 (#800/#805). A TTS check needs a TTS-mill user (770M/1100M/PCNC) to measure the collar OD and thickness, and the ER20 nut. The collar thickness (0.5 in) is an estimate (PR #829 review note).",
